      "kicker": "FAQ",
      "heading": "Frequently asked questions",
      "items": [
        { "q": "How does Lex.AI work?", "a": "AI tracks debt status in real time and automatically drafts reminders and documents (demand letters, claims). Every action only happens after your approval." },
        { "q": "Does the AI send documents itself?", "a": "No. The AI only prepares a draft — sending it or filing with a court only happens after your approval." },
        { "q": "What systems does it integrate with?", "a": "It works directly with Didox, E-IMZO, E-SUD, and OneID." },
        { "q": "Is my data safe?", "a": "Yes — each client's data is fully isolated (multi-tenant isolation), and the signature always stays on your own E-IMZO key." },
        { "q": "How do I get started?", "a": "Click \"Start for free\" or reach out for a consultation — setup takes just a few minutes." }
      ]
    },
